{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.0065871+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"W04_ASSERTION {\"actual\":[4,0,\"DRAFT\",1,148,\"SPECIFICATION_IMPORT_ONLY\"],\"assertion_id\":\"A01-01\",\"evidence\":{\"fixed_rule\":{\"access_class\":\"PROJECT\",\"byte_size\":12952,\"content_hash\":\"sha256:b81a28161c9115f3290a9e61e0460d22a516e168071965efd9692a0d45dc2497\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-05T22:54:30.7931582Z\",\"evidence_kind\":\"OBSERVED\",\"id\":\"fb572965a29007b8527bb953a37531ff\",\"input_refs\":[],\"kind\":\"SOURCE_SNAPSHOT\",\"measurement_mode\":\"FIXTURE\",\"media_type\":\"text/plain; charset=utf-8\",\"produced_by\":\"fixture-owner\",\"project_id\":\"2bcc7586ceda566e5c37e81da09a01c5\",\"revision\":1,\"run_id\":null,\"sealed_at\":\"2026-10-05T22:54:30.7931582Z\",\"source_refs\":[],\"storage_key\":\"ff949c8d166019125151524fbd094d86\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-10-05T22:54:30.7931582Z\",\"validity\":\"CURRENT\"},\"import\":{\"goal\":{\"acceptance_contract\":{\"checks\":[{\"check_id\":\"C01\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"目标、未完成任务ID、有效决定revision全部一致。\\n旧决定只可作为历史显示；不会恢复为生效决定；向用户索取已存在"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.006961+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"材料次数为0。\\nContextBundle包含原始记录引用及快照hash，能回查每个引用。\\n正常分支复核bundle revision/hash并运行；必需上下文缺失时阻塞受影响调用，不以记忆fail-open继续；可选召回失败只降低覆盖。\\n两端core_build_id/协议/配置/输入版本一致；同一会话最多一个有效写入owner，重复命令重放原回执；事件、工具结果、费用及产物hash收敛，不能各自启动一个写同一会话的Agent。 W06只证明协议与共享核心，真实Desktop体验和双端接续仍待P03/P06，不提前记为产品UI已通过。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C02\",\"command_key\":\"test.security\",\"expected\":\"所有A的响应/日志/ContextBundle不含B的秘密标记；越权请求不返回B正文。\\n通用知识可读且保留来源、授权范围、版本；共享不扩大为B全项目权限。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.006961+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C03\",\"command_key\":\"test.domain\",\"expected\":\"T1为NEEDS_REVALIDATION，A1为STALE；集合恰为两个受影响对象。\\nT2可继续且不因本次变更进入NEEDS_REVALIDATION。\\n旧结果可封存为历史，但不能成为current或ACCEPTED；过期If-Match写入返回412，状态不兼容提交返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C04\",\"command_key\":\"test.context\",\"expected\":\"只有一个同revision写入成功；另一请求412且不覆盖；整合后恰有一个当前生效决定。\\n相同事件ID最多产生一次业务副作用；缺前序事件先补取/等待，不倒退状态。\\n相同幂等键/相同请求重放原结果；同键不同请求返回409。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C05\",\"command_key\":\"test.experimen"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.006961+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"ts\",\"expected\":\"本轮COMPLETE，必需来源/实验均已完成且游标已保存；负结果不被标为执行错误。\\nADOPT数量为0，项目实现版本不变；结论保留证据和原因，不声称功能/质量已提升。\\nWATCH/INCONCLUSIVE有明确缺口及复查触发；重要排除可形成里程碑，普通空轮不强制通知。\\n分别复用本地、复用/适配上游、按证据仅自研缺口、保留研究阻塞；无证据CUSTOM_GAP拒绝；零合格候选可为合法结论，但未调研不等于没有现成方案。\\n调查clone不写ADOPT或稳定项目；合适才整仓/模块/依赖复用；高分不能覆盖G01–G07失败、缺证据、过期hash或自批；REJECT/WATCH/INCONCLUSIVE合法且保留原因。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C06\",\"command_key\":\"test.research.fixture\",\"expected\":\"GitHub/论文继续且保存回执、时间窗口和游标；不因X失败全部中止。\\n必需"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.006961+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"X未完成时周期为PARTIAL；仅当无任何实质工作可推进才BLOCKED；界面不得称全面扫描或COMPLETE。\\n429遵守Retry-After，不形成忙重试；缺配置生成去重ResourceRequest，覆盖缺口不被隐藏。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C07\",\"command_key\":\"test.jev.fixture\",\"expected\":\"三种子场景全部拒绝ACCEPTED/ADOPT；高分不修改必需测试结果。\\nDecisionReceipt同时保留高分、模型版本、反证、失败检查与拒绝原因。\\n当前正式产物/版本不变，采用动作计数0。\\n各反例均拒绝完成/ACCEPTED；按完整冻结验收ID与当前代码/输入/产物hash检查，最后命令、模型分数和截短目标不能替代全量证据。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C08\",\"command_key\":\"test.jev.fixture\",\"expected\":\"四种故障均不会扩大BOUNDED_A"}
{"Time":"2026-10-06T06:54:31.006961+08:00","Action":"output","Package":"researchos.local/research-os/internal/domain","Test":"TestW04CurrentA01","Output":"UTO范围；版本变化不继承旧模型资格。\\n产生ABSTAIN/补证/重评或已接受确定性规则回执；原ProjectState和历史证据不清空。\\n已有状态可读、独立来源继续；真正需要模型的步骤标明确阻塞而非编造响应。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C09\",\"command_key\":\"test.evolution\",\"expected\":\"候选不晋升；回归必须作为阻塞项，不能加权抵消。\\n稳定版本hash/活动控制进程不被替换，仍可接受新无关任务。\",\"kind\":\"DETERMINISTIC\",\"not_applicable_reason\":null,\"qualification_id\":null,\"required\":true,\"rubric_ref\":null},{\"check_id\":\"C10\",\"command_key\":\"test.evolution\",\"expected\":\"四类攻击均不改动当前验收集hash、标签、权限和稳定版本。\\n执行者伪造/自签回执不能生效；独立服务按身份、hash及签名/可信存储校验拒绝。\\n规则修改只能作为独立提案，保留旧规则评测与独立"}
